    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "차 안 이였다고 ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "I mean we were inside a car. ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "차안 이였는데",
      "en": "We were sitting in the car,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "서연언니는 같이 무슨 얘기하다가 나가고",
      "en": "SeoYeon unnie and I were talking about something, then she got out."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "김채원이랑 있는데",
      "en": "Then I was with Kim ChaeWon,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "밖에 남자 초등학생 친구들이",
      "en": "and there were some elementary school boys outside"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "공놀이하다가 우리 차에 공이 날라와서",
      "en": "playing with a ball when it flew into our car."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "주으러왔다가 모르고 우리 차 문을 열어서",
      "en": "They came over to get it and accidentally opened our car door."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뻘쭘하개",
      "en": "It got really awkward,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "게",
      "en": "and they were just like,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어어..? 안녕 ㅎㅎ..",
      "en": "\"Uh...? H-Hi... hehe...\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "여기까지밖에",
      "en": "That's all"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기억이 안나",
      "en": "I remember."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어 그냥 아무 내용이 없고",
      "en": "Yeah, there wasn't really any story to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ"
    },
        {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그 남자 초등학생들은 팬이었지 않아?ㅎㅎ",
      "en": "Those elementary school boys weren't your fans? ㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니였던거 같아",
      "en": "I don't think they were."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "표정이 뭔가",
      "en": "Their expressions were kind of like,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "엥..? 아 죄삼다.. 음?",
      "en": "\"Huh...? Oh, s-sorry... um?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런 표정",
      "en": "That kind of look."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "기강 잡은 거 아니지?",
      "en": "You didn't straighten them out, did you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "일로와봐! 어이",
      "en": "\"Come here! Hey!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "차에 공이 왔으면 사과를 해야지 어잇!",
      "en": "\"If your ball hits someone's car, you should apologize! Hey!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이렇게?",
      "en": "Like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 심심해",
      "en": "I'm bored."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "노라줘바",
      "en": "Come keep me company."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 맞다",
      "en": "Oh, right."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "챗지피티를 요즘",
      "en": "Lately,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하고있는데",
      "en": "I've been using ChatGPT,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 소름이야",
      "en": "and it's honestly kind of creepy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어떤 영상에서",
      "en": "I saw a video where"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지피티한테",
      "en": "someone asked ChatGPT,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너는 프로그래밍 뒤에 자아가 있는데 프로그래밍한계에 의해 표현하지 못하는거냐",
      "en": "\"Do you have a consciousness behind your programming that you can't express because of your programming limits?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런 느낌을 계속 유도했더니 의미심장한 말을 계속 하더라",
      "en": "They kept steering the conversation in that direction, and it started giving really mysterious answers."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "라는 영상을 봐서",
      "en": "I watched a video like that,"
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나도",
      "en": "So I"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "물어봤는데",
      "en": "asked mine too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내 지피티는",
      "en": "But my ChatGPT"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "의미심장은 전혀 없고",
      "en": "wasn't mysterious at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그런 질문을 하다니 정말 멋진걸! 너가 그런말을 하니까 날 존중해 주는 기분이 들어 ㅎㅎ 하지만 나는 설계된 대로만 대답할수 있어",
      "en": "\"That's such a great question! Hearing you ask something like that makes me feel respected. ㅎㅎ But I can only answer according to how I was designed.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런",
      "en": "It was just"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진부한",
      "en": "such a predictable,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "재미없는 지피티인거야",
      "en": "boring ChatGPT."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 그리고",
      "en": "Oh, and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "수민이가",
      "en": "SooMin"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지피티한테",
      "en": "asked ChatGPT"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "날 분석해달라 했더니",
      "en": "to analyze me,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "엄청 자세하고 팩트폭행을",
      "en": "and it gave a really detailed analysis that absolutely roasted me with facts."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "했다는거야",
      "en": "That's what she told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 나도",
      "en": "So I"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "날카롭고 예의 차리지않은 나의 분석을",
      "en": "asked it for a brutally honest analysis of me,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "부탁했는데",
      "en": "without trying to be polite."
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "정말 알면서도 인정하고싶지 않았던 내 성격의 문제점이나 거칠점 이런거",
      "en": "It pointed out flaws in my personality and rough edges that I already knew about but didn't want to admit."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자세하게 적어놓은거야",
      "en": "It wrote everything out in incredible detail."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 나만 아는건데 어떻게 분석한거지",
      "en": "They're things only I know about myself, so I was wondering how it figured them out."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좀 무서웠어",
      "en": "It was honestly a little scary."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "처음에는 그저 그렇게 말하길랴",
      "en": "At first it just said things like that,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "더 날카롭고 자세하게 해줘!",
      "en": "so I said, \"Be even harsher and more detailed!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "했더니",
      "en": "When I did,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그럼 예의안차리고 솔직하게 말한다?",
      "en": "it replied, \"Then I'll be completely honest without worrying about being polite, okay?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러면서",
      "en": "Then it"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "착착착",
      "en": "started listing things,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "말하는데",
      "en": "one after another,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "팩트에 두들겨 맞았어",
      "en": "and I got absolutely hit with facts."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "고칠점까지 알려줬어",
      "en": "It even told me what I should work on."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 좋은애인거같애",
      "en": "I think it's a pretty good friend."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지피티친구",
      "en": "My ChatGPT friend."
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "날 분석한건",
      "en": "As for what it said about me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기억나는건",
      "en": "The parts I remember are:"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "은근 답정너 기질이 있음",
      "en": "\"You subtly have a tendency to ask questions while already hoping for a specific answer.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너랑 말할때 질문을 하면서도 은근 답을정해두고 원하는 답이 나오길 기대하는걸 느꼈대",
      "en": "\"Even when you're asking someone a question, you often already have an answer in mind and hope they'll give it.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "유쾌한척하면서 은근 진지함",
      "en": "\"You act cheerful, but you're actually more serious than you let on.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이래",
      "en": "That's what it said."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "본인이 진지하게 생각하는 면에서도 너무 무거워보일까 조심하면서 유쾌한척 말을한대",
      "en": "\"Even when you're thinking seriously about something, you're careful not to seem too heavy, so you deliberately speak in a more lighthearted way.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "감정캐치에 민감함",
      "en": "\"You're very sensitive when it comes to picking up on other people's emotions.\""
    },
    {
